<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Slurp — purchase the premier Minecraft client engineered for multi-server bypasses and total dominance.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#181a20">
<meta property="og:title" content="Slurp — Products">
<meta property="og:description" content="Slurp — purchase the premier Minecraft client engineered for multi-server bypasses and total dominance.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'/%3E">
<title>Slurp Client</title>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

:root{
--bg:#181a20;
--bg-nav:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 88%,transparent);
--bg-raised:#1e2028;
--surface:#22252e;
--surface2:#292c38;
--surface-hover:#2e3244;
--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
--accent:#60a5fa;
--accent-hover:#4f96f5;
--on-accent:#ffffff;
--text:#f0f1f4;
--muted:#5b6070;
--subtle:#8b95a8;
--footer-copy:#3c3f50;
--fw-bold:700;
--nav-height:56px;
--layout-max:900px;
--layout-product:540px;
--layout-section-sub:360px;
--blur-nav:12px;
--focus-offset:3px;
--focus-outline:2px;
--lift-btn:-1px;
--lift-card:-4px;
--z-nav:10;
--z-skip:200;
--duration-fast:.15s;
--duration-base:.18s;
--duration-card:.22s;
--lh-body:1.5;
--lh-heading:1.15;
--lh-sub:1.75;
--lh-card:1.8;
--fs-xs:11px;
--fs-sm:12px;
--fs-base:13px;
--fs-md:15px;
--fs-body:14px;
--fs-title-min:22px;
--fs-title-fluid:3.5vw;
--fs-title-max:32px;
--space-xs:3px;
--space-sm:8px;
--space-btn:11px;
--space-mobile:20px;
--space-1:6px;
--space-2:10px;
--space-3:16px;
--space-4:18px;
--space-5:24px;
--space-6:32px;
--space-7:38px;
--space-8:44px;
--space-9:56px;
--space-10:80px;
--radius-sm:4px;
--radius-md:12px;
--radius-lg:16px;
--radius-pill:999px
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
}

body{
font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;
font-size:var(--fs-body);
line-height:var(--lh-body);
background:var(--bg);
color:var(--text);
overflow-x:hidden;
min-height:100vh;
-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale
}

.skip-link{
position:absolute;
top:-100%;
left:var(--space-5);
background:var(--accent);
color:var(--on-accent);
font-size:var(--fs-base);
padding:var(--space-sm) var(--space-3);
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
text-decoration:none;
z-index:var(--z-skip)
}

.skip-link:focus{top:var(--space-2)}

:focus-visible{
outline:var(--focus-outline) solid var(--accent);
outline-offset:var(--focus-offset);
border-radius:var(--radius-sm)
}

nav{
position:sticky;
top:0;
z-index:var(--z-nav);
display:flex;
align-items:center;
height:var(--nav-height);
padding:0 var(--space-9);
background:var(--bg-nav);
backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur-nav));
-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(var(--blur-nav));
border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)
}

.nav-inner{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
width:100%;
max-width:var(--layout-max);
margin:0 auto
}

.nav-logo{
font-size:var(--fs-md);
font-weight:var(--fw-bold);
color:var(--text);
text-decoration:none;
letter-spacing:0.025em;
flex:1
}

.nav-links{
display:flex;
gap:var(--space-6);
list-style:none;
align-items:center;
flex:2;
justify-content:center
}

.nav-links a{
color:var(--muted);
text-decoration:none;
font-size:var(--fs-base);
letter-spacing:0.015em;
transition:color var(--duration-base)
}

.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}

.nav-right{
flex:1;
display:flex;
justify-content:flex-end
}

.btn-discord{
background-color:var(--accent);
color:var(--on-accent);
font-size:var(--fs-sm);
letter-spacing:0.025em;
padding:var(--space-sm) var(--space-4);
border-radius:var(--radius-pill);
text-decoration:none;
transition:background-color var(--duration-base),transform var(--duration-fast)
}

.btn-discord:hover{
background-color:var(--accent-hover);
transform:translateY(var(--lift-btn))
}

#products{
padding:var(--space-10) var(--space-9);
max-width:var(--layout-product);
margin:0 auto
}

.section-title{
font-size:clamp(var(--fs-title-min),var(--fs-title-fluid),var(--fs-title-max));
font-weight:var(--fw-bold);
text-align:center;
color:var(--text);
letter-spacing:-0.015em;
line-height:var(--lh-heading);
margin-bottom:var(--space-2)
}

.section-sub{
text-align:center;
color:var(--muted);
font-size:var(--fs-base);
line-height:var(--lh-sub);
max-width:var(--layout-section-sub);
margin:0 auto var(--space-8)
}

.product-card{
background:var(--surface);
border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
transition:transform var(--duration-card)
}

.product-card:hover{transform:translateY(var(--lift-card))}

.card-body{padding:var(--space-5)}

.card-header{
display:flex;
align-items:baseline;
margin-bottom:var(--space-2)
}

.card-name{
font-size:var(--fs-md);
font-weight:var(--fw-bold);
color:var(--text)
}

.product-price{
font-size:var(--fs-body);
font-weight:var(--fw-bold);
color:var(--accent);
margin-left:auto
}

.card-rule{
border:none;
height:1px;
background:var(--border);
margin-bottom:var(--space-3)
}

.card-desc{
font-size:var(--fs-sm);
color:var(--muted);
line-height:var(--lh-card);
margin-bottom:var(--space-4)
}

.product-tags{
display:flex;
gap:var(--space-1);
flex-wrap:wrap;
margin-bottom:var(--space-4)
}

.tag{
background:var(--bg-raised);
color:var(--subtle);
font-size:var(--fs-xs);
padding:var(--space-xs) var(--space-btn);
border-radius:var(--radius-pill)
}

.buy-btn{
display:block;
background-color:var(--surface2);
color:var(--subtle);
font-size:var(--fs-base);
padding:var(--space-btn);
border-radius:var(--radius-md);
text-decoration:none;
text-align:center;
transition:background-color var(--duration-base),color var(--duration-base)
}

.buy-btn:hover{
background-color:var(--surface-hover);
color:var(--text)
}

footer{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:space-between;
padding:var(--space-4) var(--space-9);
border-top:1px solid var(--border)
}

.footer-logo{
font-size:var(--fs-sm);
font-weight:var(--fw-bold);
color:var(--text);
text-decoration:none
}

.footer-copy{
font-size:var(--fs-xs);
color:var(--footer-copy)
}

@media (max-width:700px){
nav{padding:0 var(--space-mobile)}
#products{padding-left:var(--space-mobile);padding-right:var(--space-mobile)}
footer{padding:var(--space-4) var(--space-mobile)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>

<nav aria-label="Main">
<div class="nav-inner">
<a href="slurp.html" class="nav-logo">Slurp</a>
<ul class="nav-links">
<li><a href="slurp.html">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="slurp.html#features">Features</a></li>
<li><a href="products.html">Products</a></li>
</ul>
<div class="nav-right">
<a href="https://discord.gg/QCPzTp9e3m" class="btn-discord" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a>
</div>
</div>
</nav>

<main id="main">

<section id="products">
<h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need</h2>
<p class="section-sub">The full suite of tools designed to elevate your gameplay and deliver a definitive competitive edge.</p>

<div class="product-card">
<div class="card-body">
<div class="card-header">
<h3 class="card-name">Slurp Client</h3>
<span class="product-price">USD 24.99</span>
</div>
<hr class="card-rule">
<p class="card-desc">The ultimate solution for multi-server bypasses. Expertly optimized for Watchdog and industry-leading anti-cheats with a primary focus on stealth and reliability.</p>
<div class="product-tags">
<span class="tag">Hypixel</span>
<span class="tag">Cubecraft</span>
<span class="tag">BlocksMC</span>
<span class="tag">Lifetime Updates</span>
<span class="tag">Closet &amp; Blatant</span>
</div>
<a href="https://discord.gg/QCPzTp9e3m" class="buy-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Purchase</a>
</div>
</div>

</section>

</main>

<footer>
<a href="slurp.html" class="footer-logo">Slurp</a>
<span class="footer-copy">Slurp Client &copy; All Rights Reserved</span>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
